        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulekere eitima, obugobya, akachubirano n'okuchwelererana. Ebi byona mubilekere omu ngeli zona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mube nk'obukelemeke, mugonze amata, kyonkai amata agatakatifu ag'omwoyo, gabakuze gabagobye aha kurokoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manyasi mwarolizeho, mwamanyire okwo Ruhanga aba mufura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugobe Yesu Kirisito eibare ly'oburora, elyayangirwe abantu, kyonkai ahali Ruhanga likaba ibare elironkwa mara ely'eiguzi lihango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushushe amabaare g'oburora, murugwemu enju y'omwoyo, n'oruganda rutakatifu rw'abakuhani, mutambire Ruhanga ebitambo by'omwoyo ebilikumushemelera mwemire na Yesu Kirisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enshonga omu bihandiko kikahandiikwa kiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe inywe muli ihanga elironkwa, abakuhani b'Omukama, eihanga litakatifu, abantu ba Ruhanga, abe nyabwe, mubone kuranga oburungi bwa Yesu Kirisito ayabesire akabaihya omu mwilima, akabatahya omu mushanagwe katangaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eirai mukaba mutali ihanga, kyonkai mbwenu mwabaire ihanga lya Ruhanga; eirai mukaba mutagiliirwe buganyizi, kyonkai mbwenu mwagiliirwe obuganyizi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagonzibwa, nimbatagiliza, muli bafuruki mara bazahe, mwekenge amairu g'obunyama agatura nigabema kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugire emirolere mirungi omu Banyamahanga. Kityo n'orwo bakubagamba okwo muli babi, ahanyuma bashobore kubona ebikorwa byanyu ebirungi bashube basingize Ruhanga aha kiro ky'amaheleruka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha bwa Mukama muhulire buli butwazi. Alikaba ali rubamba nk'okwo omukama ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anga abagavana abo ab'atumire kubonabonyia ababi n'okusiima abarungi, mubahulire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba Ruhanga nagonza kamukora kurungi mukabona kusiza abafera abatalikumanya kantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugire emilembe aha mwoyo, mara emilembe etali ya bugobya. Mube bairu ba Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukunire abantu bona. Mugonze bataahi banyu abalikwesiga. Mutine Ruhanga kandi mukunire omukuru w'eihanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe bairu muhulire bakama banyu n'okubakunira muno. Mutahulira bafura na barungi bonkai, kyonkai n'ab'omwaga mubahulire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobona omuntu ayegumisiliza obushasi nibamutura bushai, mara kandi ateebire Ruhanga, omuntu nk'ogwo asiimwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakusiimwa aha rwa nshongaki kamuraba nimwegumisiliza okuterwa ahakuba mufakaire? Nawe kamulikukorage mukaba nirwo muterwa kyonkai mukegumisiliza, aho Ruhanga nabasiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu nigwo mweto gwanyu, kuba na Kirisito akabashasira, yabasigira obulebero mushobore kumurondora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenene tiyakozire bufu mara tiyabeiyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai kabamujumire tiyabagarukiremu kubajuma. Akashaasha kyonkai tiyakangire muntu; shana akesiga omuramuzi w'amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akatilira amafu gaitu aha muti k'atugalekera tukaba bagorogoki. Amahutage gakakiza inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukaba muhabire nk'entaama, kyonkai mbwenu mugarukire aha Mushumba mara Omulinzi w'emyoyo yanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
